A function "__hap_reserve_something".

To reserve something.
  Call the function "__hap_reserve_something" with that something.
End.

To reserve somebody on /* TODO: 2nd something */ someone to do something.
  Call the function "__hap_reserve_something" with that somebody, that someone and that something.
End.

A function "__hap_release_something".

To release something.
  Call the function "__hap_release_something" with that something.
End.


